{"unit_id": "tag:01UB:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n域（field）上的代数（algebra）<MATH_0001>（基域为<MATH_0002>）称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>全局完全交（global complete intersection）（在<MATH_0003>上）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果<MATH_0004>且<MATH_0005>。域（field）上的代数（algebra）<MATH_0006>（基域为<MATH_0007>）称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>局部完全交（local complete intersection）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果<MATH_0008>可由一族标准开集（standard opens）覆盖，且其中每个都是<MATH_0009>上的全局完全交（global complete intersections）。见《代数（Algebra）》的第<REF_0001>节。回顾一下，称环映射（ring map）<MATH_0010>为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>合切（syntomic）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>的，如果它是有限表示（finite presentation）且平坦（flat）的，并且以局部完全交（local complete intersection）环（rings）为纤维（fibres），见《代数（Algebra）》的定义<REF_0002>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "global complete intersection", "target_term": "全局完全交"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection", "target_term": "局部完全交"}, {"source_term": "standard opens", "target_term": "标准开集"}, {"source_term": "global complete intersections", "target_term": "全局完全交"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection", "target_term": "局部完全交"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "第一项定义给出的基域"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第一项定义所讨论的域上代数"}, {"source_term": "global complete intersection", "target_term": "全局完全交", "context": "第一项定义命名的对象"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "第二项定