{"unit_id": "tag:01UC:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 称<MATH_0002><TEXTITOPEN_0001>合切于（syntomic at）<MATH_0003><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果存在仿射开（affine open）邻域（neighbourhood）<MATH_0004>（包含<MATH_0005>）和仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0006>，满足<MATH_0007>，并且诱导的环映射（ring map）<MATH_0008>是合切（syntomic）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 称<MATH_0009>是<TEXTITOPEN_0002>合切（syntomic）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>的，如果它合切于（syntomic at）<MATH_0010>中的每一点（point）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0011>且<MATH_0012>是合切（syntomic）的，则称<MATH_0013>为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>局部完全交（local complete intersection）（在<MATH_0014>上）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0005> 仿射概形（affine schemes）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0004>标准合切（standard syntomic）<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>的，如果存在全局相对完全交（global relative complete intersection）<MATH_0016>（见《代数（Algebra）》的定义<REF_0001>），使得<MATH_0017>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0018>\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic at", "target_term": "合切于"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "syntomic at", "target_term": "合切于"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection", "target_term": "局部完全交"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "standard syntomic", "target_term": "标准合切"}, {"source_term": "global relative complete intersection", "target_term": "全局相对完全交"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "开头所给态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "该定义所讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "syntomic at", "target_term": "合切于", "context": "第一项定义中在指定点处的合切性"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "第一项所取邻域的性质"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "指定点所取的邻域"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第一项所取的另一开集"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "所取开集诱导的环之间的映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "第一项中诱导环映射的条件"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "第二项定义的态射整体性质"}, {"source_term": "syntomic at", "target_term": "合切于", "context": "第二项用于定义整体性质的逐点条件"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "第二项逐一考察的对象"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "第三项中的条件"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection", "target_term": "局部完全交", "context": "第三项中定义的对象"}, {"source_term": "affine schemes", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "第四项中态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第四项所讨论的映射"}, {"source_term": "standard syntomic", "target_term": "标准合切", "context": "第四项所定义的性质"}, {"source_term": "global relative complete intersection", "target_term": "全局相对完全交", "context": "标准合切条件中取的完全交"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所引定义所在的章节名"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "标准合切条件中的关系"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UB:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n文献中，合切（syntomic）态射（morphism）有时称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平坦（flat）的局部完全交态射（local complete intersection morphism）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。这类（class）态射（morphisms）用起来很方便。例如，可以用它们定义合切（syntomic）拓扑（topology），它比光滑（smooth）和平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topologies）更细（finer），但有许多相同的形式性质（formal properties）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n全局相对完全交（global relative complete intersection）（我们曾用它来定义标准合切（standard syntomic）环映射（ring maps））特别是平坦（flat）的。我们将在《态射（Morphisms）续论》的第<REF_0001>节中讨论这样一些态射（morphisms）<MATH_0001>：它们局部具有形式<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>中的某个科祖尔正则序列（Koszul-regular sequence）。这样的态射（morphism）将称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>局部完全交态射（local complete intersection morphism）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。有了这个定义后，态射（morphism）是合切（syntomic）的，当且仅当它是平坦（flat）的局部完全交态射（local complete intersection morphism）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n注意，合切（syntomic）态射（morphism）的定义没有分离性（separation）或拟紧性（quasi-compactness）假设。因此，是否合切（syntomic）是源（source）上的局部（local）问题。下面给出精确的结论。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection morphism", "target_term": "局部完全交态射"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "finer", "target_term": "更细"}, {"source_term": "formal properties", "target_term": "形式性质"}, {"source_term": "global relative complete intersection", "target_term": "全局相对完全交"}, {"source_term": "standard syntomic", "target_term": "标准合切"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Koszul-regular sequence", "target_term": "科祖尔正则序列"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection morphism", "target_term": "局部完全交态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection morphism", "target_term": "局部完全交态射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "separation", "target_term": "分离性"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compactness", "target_term": "拟紧性"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "source", "target_term": "源"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "文献中所讨论的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "文献中命名的对象"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "文献所用名称中的性质"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection morphism", "target_term": "局部完全交态射", "context": "文献所用名称中的态射类别"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类", "context": "合切态射构成的类别"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "该类所含的对象"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "用这类态射定义的拓扑类型"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "可由这类态射定义的拓扑"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "用于比较的第一种拓扑"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "用于比较的第二种拓扑"}, {"source_term": "topologies", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "与合切拓扑比较的两种拓扑"}, {"source_term": "finer", "target_term": "更细", "context": "合切拓扑和另外两种拓扑的关系"}, {"source_term": "formal properties", "target_term": "形式性质", "context": "上述拓扑所共有的性质"}, {"source_term": "global relative complete intersection", "target_term": "全局相对完全交", "context": "定义标准合切环映射所用的对象"}, {"source_term": "standard syntomic", "target_term": "标准合切", "context": "由全局相对完全交定义的性质"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "标准合切条件所讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "全局相对完全交的性质"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所引后续章节名的组成部分"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "后续章节讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "Koszul-regular sequence", "target_term": "科祖尔正则序列", "context": "态射局部形式所涉及的序列"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "满足上述局部形式的映射"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection morphism", "target_term": "局部完全交态射", "context": "后续将引入的名称"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "等价条件所讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "等价条件的一侧"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "等价条件另一侧的性质之一"}, {"source_term": "local complete intersection morphism", "target_term": "局部完全交态射", "context": "等价条件另一侧的性质之一"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "末段所讨论的定义"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "末段所讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "separation", "target_term": "分离性", "context": "该定义不作的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compactness", "target_term": "拟紧性", "context": "该定义不作的第二项假设"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "末段将要局部判定的性质"}, {"source_term": "source", "target_term": "源", "context": "在其上局部判定该性质"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "合切性在源上的判定方式"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UD:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>是合切（syntomic）的。\n<STRUCT_0003> 对任意仿射开集（affine opens）<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>，若<MATH_0005>，则环映射（ring map）<MATH_0006>是合切（syntomic）的。\n<STRUCT_0004> 存在开（open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>和开（open）覆盖（coverings）<MATH_0008>，使得态射（morphisms）<MATH_0009>、<MATH_0010>均是合切（syntomic）的。\n<STRUCT_0005> 存在仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0011>和仿射开覆盖（affine open coverings）<MATH_0012>，使得环映射（ring map）<MATH_0013>对所有<MATH_0014>都是合切（syntomic）的。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n此外，若<MATH_0015>是合切（syntomic）的，则对任意开子概形（open subschemes）<MATH_0016>、<MATH_0017>，若<MATH_0018>，则限制（restriction）<MATH_0019>是合切（syntomic）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine open coverings", "target_term": "仿射开覆盖"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源和目标"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理所讨论的对象"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "四个陈述之间的逻辑关系"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一项所论的映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "第一项的整体性质"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第二项任取的开集"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "第二项中仿射开集对应的映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "第二项要求的环映射性质"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "第三项存在的第一种覆盖的性质"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第三项中所取的第一个覆盖"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "第三项存在的另一族覆盖的性质"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第三项所取的另一族覆盖"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第三项由覆盖得到的映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "第三项要求的逐态射性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "第四项的第一个覆盖所用的开集"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "第四项所取的第一个覆盖"}, {"source_term": "affine open coverings", "target_term": "仿射开覆盖", "context": "第四项所取的另一族覆盖"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "第四项逐一考察的映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "第四项要求的逐环映射性质"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "附加结论的假设"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "附加结论任取的对象"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "附加结论所得的映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "限制所得映射的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UD:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>可知，只需证明性质（property）“<MATH_0001>是合切（syntomic）的”是局部（local）的。我们验证定义<REF_0002>的条件（a）、（b）和（c）。由《代数（Algebra）》的引理<REF_0003>，合切（syntomic）性在基变换（base change）下保持，因此（a）成立。由《代数（Algebra）》的引理<REF_0004>，合切（syntomic）性在复合（composition）下保持，而且对于任意环（ring）<MATH_0002>，环映射（ring map）<MATH_0003>显然是合切（syntomic）的。因此（b）成立。最后，由《代数（Algebra）》的引理<REF_0005>知（c）成立。\n", "allowed_english": ["a", "b", "c"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "property", "target_term": "性质"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "property", "target_term": "性质", "context": "需要验证为局部的性质"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "引号内所说的性质"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "需要检查的性质判定方式"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "用于验证条件（a）的引理所在的章节名"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "在基变换下保持的性质"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "验证条件（a）所用的运算"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "用于验证条件（b）的引理所在的章节名"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "在复合下保持的性质"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "验证条件（b）所用的运算"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "验证条件（b）时任取的对象"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "验证条件（b）时考察的映射"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "该环映射所具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "用于验证条件（c）的引理所在的章节名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01UH:statement", "translation": "两个合切（syntomic）态射（morphisms）的复合（composition）是合切（syntomic）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "所取两个态射各自的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "参与复合的两个对象"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "引理中施加于两个态射的运算"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合切", "context": "复合所得的性质"}], "notes": []}
